flowchart TB
  A[Customer selects own transaction] --> B[Bank validates identity, ownership, duplicate, evidence]
  B --> C{Transaction kind?}
  C --> CARD[Card purchase]
  C --> DEBIT[Debit order]
  C --> FEE[Bank charge]
  CARD --> CD[Issuer checks reason and scheme deadline]
  CD --> CB[Chargeback initiated / network reference]
  CB --> MER{Merchant outcome?}
  MER -->|Accepts| FS[Settlement pending]
  MER -->|Representment| REP[Issuer reviews evidence and decides]
  REP --> FS
  DEBIT --> D1[Effective-dated policy + mandate type]
  D1 --> D2{Valid authorised DebiCheck?}
  D2 -->|Yes| REF[Ordinary reversal ineligible / refer to bank]
  D2 -->|No| D3{Within applicable dispute window?}
  D3 -->|Yes| AMT[Optional internal review tier <= or > R2000]
  D3 -->|No| REF2[Out-of-window enquiry or escalation]
  AMT --> FR[Durable reversal request to bank core]
  FR --> FS
  FEE --> BR[Internal investigation]
  BR --> ADJ{Approve adjustment?}
  ADJ -->|Yes| FS
  ADJ -->|No| DEC[Declined with reason]
  FS --> REC{Ledger confirms posting?}
  REC -->|Yes| DONE[Funds confirmed and case closed]
  REC -->|Unknown| UNKNOWN[Pending / reconcile by stable ref]
  UNKNOWN --> REC
  REC -->|Rejected| DEC
  DONE --> TL[Append immutable timeline; notify customer]
  DEC --> TL
  REF --> TL
  REF2 --> TL
